Description:

A WebDAV, CalDAV or CardDAV DELETE or MOVE of a collection now fails with
423 Locked while a member resource holds an unexpired write lock, unless the
lock owner submits that member's lock token in the If header (RFC 4918,
Sections 7, 9.6.1 and 9.9.2).  Previously the collection was deleted or moved
along with the locked member.


